ent-AdvancedCyberneticLiver = advanced cybernetic liver
    .desc = A robust synthetic liver that filters small doses of poison and neutralizes alcohol poisoning.
ent-BasicCyberneticStomach = basic cybernetic stomach
    .desc = A simple synthetic stomach that digests food more slowly than an organic stomach.
ent-UpgradedCyberneticStomach = upgraded cybernetic stomach
    .desc = A synthetic stomach that digests food faster than an organic stomach.
ent-AdvancedCyberneticStomach = advanced cybernetic stomach
    .desc = A robust synthetic stomach that digests food twice as fast as an organic stomach.
ent-AdvancedCyberneticHeart = advanced cybernetic heart
    .desc = A synthetic heart that rapidly replenishes lost blood, suppresses bleeding and briefly restores mobility in critical condition.
ent-GlowCyberneticEyes = high luminosity cybernetic eyes
    .desc = Synthetic eyes with lights that match the owner's eye colour.
ent-ActionToggleCyberneticEyes = Toggle eye lights
    .desc = Turn the lights in your cybernetic eyes on or off.
ent-NutrimentPumpAugment = nutriment pump augment
    .desc = A chest implant that synthesizes nutrition when its owner is starving.
ent-NutrimentPumpPlusAugment = nutriment pump PLUS augment
    .desc = An improved chest implant that synthesizes nutrition as soon as its owner is peckish.
ent-BreathingTubeAugment = breathing tube augment
    .desc = An implanted internals connector that allows its owner to breathe from a tank without a mask.
cybernetics-nutriment-pump-feed = You feel less hungry...
