ent-SurgeryRemoveNutrimentPump = Remove nutriment pump
ent-SurgeryOpenBreathingTubeCavity = Open cavity for breathing tube
ent-SurgeryInsertBreathingTube = Insert breathing tube
ent-SurgeryRemoveBreathingTube = Remove breathing tube
ent-AntiDropAugment = anti-drop implant
    .desc = A brain implant that contracts the hand muscles to hold onto carried items. Twitch your ear to relax your grip.
ent-CnsRebooterAugment = CNS rebooter implant
    .desc = A brain implant that automatically restores control of the central nervous system after a stun. It briefly resists further stuns and injury-induced sluggishness before recharging.
ent-ActionToggleAntiDrop = Toggle grip lock
    .desc = Contract or relax your hand muscles to retain or release the items you are holding.
anti-drop-tightened = Your grip tightens.
anti-drop-relaxed = Your hands relax.
anti-drop-empty = You are not holding anything. Your hands relax.
cns-rebooter-activated = Your CNS rebooter restores control of your body!
cns-rebooter-ready = Your CNS rebooter is ready.
